            "id": 1516,
            "type": "Article",
            "title": "Bolalar tishlarini yuvish (rasmlarda)",
            "created_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2022-01-21T20:28:56+01:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EFri, 01/21/2022 - 20:28\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "updated_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-05-19T04:20:43+02:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003ETue, 05/19/2026 - 04:20\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "summary": "Bolalar tishlari haqidaBolalar tishlarini yuvish (rasmlarda) © raisechildren.netSut tishlari",
            "body": "\u003Ch2\u003EBolalar tishlari haqida\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2025-11/pictures-uz-02.jpg?itok=MUYgQ7sH\" width=\"1200\" height=\"653\" alt=\"bola tishlari\" loading=\"lazy\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cem\u003EBolalar tishlarini yuvish (rasmlarda) © raisechildren.net\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESut tishlari har xil tartibda chiqishi mumkin. Uch yoshga kelib, 20 ta sut tishing barchasi chiqib boʻladi. Ilk sut tishlari chiqishi bilan ularni tozalashni boshlang. Kichkintoyning milki va har bir tishning hamma tomonini tozalash uchun kichik, yumshoq tish choʻtkasi yoki yuz yuvish vositasidan foydalaning.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Carticle class=\"media media--type-image media--view-mode-default\"\u003E          \u003Cdiv class=\"field field--name-field-media-image field--type-image field--label-visually_hidden\"\u003E                  \u003Cdiv class=\"field__item\"\u003E  \u003Cimg src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/styles/content_1200xh_/public/2025-11/pictures-uz-03.jpg?itok=bQNVQxEs\" width=\"1200\" height=\"665\" alt=\"kattalar ishlari\" loading=\"lazy\" typeof=\"foaf:Image\" class=\"image-style-content-1200xh-\"\u003E\u003C/div\u003E          \u003C/div\u003E  \u003C/article\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cem\u003EBolalar tishlarini yuvish (rasmlarda) © raisechildren.ne\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E6 yoshdan 20 yoshgacha boʻlgan davrda barcha sut tishlari oʻrnini 32 ta doimiy qoziq tishlar egallaydi. Tishlarini tozalashda bolaga 8 yoshga yetgunicha yordam bering va bu jarayonni nazorat qiling. Tish va milklarni kuniga ikki marta, ertalab va kechqurun, yotishdan oldin tozalang.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003ETishlarni tozalash: boshlash\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Brushing-childrens-teeth-PIP-3.gif\" alt\u003E\u003Cem\u003EBolalar tishlarini yuvish (rasmlarda) © raisechildren.net\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E18 oygacha tishlarni faqat suv bilan yuving. 18 oydan 6 yoshgacha tarkibida ftor moddasi past boʻlgan tish pastasidan noʻxatdek miqdorda ishlating. 6 yoshdan boshlab kattalar uchun moʻljallangan ftor tarkibli tish pastasidan noʻxatdek miqdorda foydalaning. Bolalarga mos yumshoq, kichkina tish choʻtkasini ishlating.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Brushing-childrens-teeth-PIP-4.gif\" alt\u003E\u003Cem\u003EBolalar tishlarini yuvish (rasmlarda) © raisechildren.net\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYorugʻ joyda, yaxshisi, oynaning oldida farzandingizning orqa tomonida turing yoki oʻtiring. Bunda farzandingiz sizning nima qilayotganingizni koʻrib turadi. Oʻzingiz oʻtirishingiz, bolajonlar yoki goʻdaklarni tizzangizga yotqizishingiz mumkin, bu yanada qulayroqdir.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Brushing-childrens-teeth-PIP-5.gif\" alt\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cem\u003EBolalar tishlarini yuvish (rasmlarda) © raisechildren.ne\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBoʻsh qoʻlingiz bilan bolajonni iyagidan ushlab turing. Undan ogʻzini ochishni va “aaa” deyishni soʻrang. Tishlarning milk yonidagi qismida oq chiziq yoki jigarrang dogʻlar kabi kariyes belgilari yoʻqligini tekshiring. Milk chizigʻi atrofida tish toshmasi paydo boʻlmaganiga eʼtibor bering.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003ETishlarni tozalash: qadamlar\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Brushing-childrens-teeth-PIP-6.gif\" alt\u003E\u003Cem\u003EBolalar tishlarini yuvish (rasmlarda) © raisechildren.net\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKichik aylana harakatlar bilan milklar va har bir tishning hamma tomonlarini tozalang. Barcha chaynov yuzalari boʻylab choʻtkani oldinga va orqaga qarab yurgizing.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Brushing-childrens-teeth-PIP-7.gif\" alt\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cem\u003EBolalar tishlarini yuvish (rasmlarda) © raisechildren.net\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ETish tozalash tugagach, bola tish pastasi qoldiqlarini tupurib tashlasin, lekin ogʻzini chaymasin. Choʻtkani yuving va qurishi uchun toza joyga qoʻying.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Brushing-childrens-teeth-PIP-8.gif\" alt\u003E\u003Cem\u003EBolalar tishlarini yuvish (rasmlarda) © raisechildren.net\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EFarzandingizga shakarli ovqat yoki ichimliklar, shuningdek, toʻshakda ona suti yoki sunʼiy ozuqani berishdan saqlaning. Oziqlantirgandan keyin doimo idishini olib qoʻying.\u003C/p\u003E",
