            "title": "Kichkintoy bilan oʻqish: rasmlar asosida",
            "created_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2021-11-26T17:00:25+01:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EFri, 11/26/2021 - 17:00\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "updated_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-05-19T04:20:43+02:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003ETue, 05/19/2026 - 04:20\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "summary": "Oʻynang va farzandingiz bilan oʻzaro aloqada boʻling. Gaplashing va “Oʻqish usullari”ni mutolaa qiling.",
            "body": "\u003Ch2\u003EKichkintoy bilan oʻynang va muloqot qiling\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg alt=\"Chaqaloq bilan o'qish: rasmlarda\" src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Reading-with-your-toddler-PIP-1.jpg\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKichkintoy bilan uning nima qilayotgani toʻgʻrisida gaplashing.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg alt=\"Chaqaloq bilan o'qish: rasmlarda\" src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Reading-with-your-toddler-PIP-2.jpg\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESiz va farzandingiz atrofingizda koʻrayotgan harflarni koʻrsating.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg alt=\"Chaqaloq bilan o'qish: rasmlarda\" src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Reading-with-your-toddler-PIP-3.jpg\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EOʻz musiqangizni yarating – birgalikda kuylang va raqsga tushing.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EOʻqish usullari\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg alt=\"Chaqaloq bilan o'qish: rasmlarda\" src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Reading-with-your-toddler-PIP-4.jpg\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBir xil hikoya va qofiyalarni qayta-qayta takrorlang.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg alt=\"Chaqaloq bilan o'qish: rasmlarda\" src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Reading-with-your-toddler-PIP-5.jpg\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBir xil hikoya va qofiyalarni qayta-qayta takrorlang.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg alt=\"Chaqaloq bilan o'qish: rasmlarda\" src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Reading-with-your-toddler-PIP-6.jpg\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKoʻchaga chiqayotib, kitoblarni yigʻing.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Ch2\u003EOʻqish usullari\u003C/h2\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg alt=\"Chaqaloq bilan o'qish: rasmlarda\" src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Reading-with-your-toddler-PIP-7.jpg\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESahifalarni birgalikda varaqlang.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg alt=\"Chaqaloq bilan o'qish: rasmlarda\" src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Reading-with-your-toddler-PIP-8.jpg\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKitobni birdaniga tugatish shart emas, bir nechta varaqni oʻqishning oʻzi kifoya.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg alt=\"Chaqaloq bilan o'qish: rasmlarda\" src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Reading-with-your-toddler-PIP-9.jpg\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKutubxonadagi mashgʻulotlarga qoʻshiling – bu bepul.\u003C/p\u003E",
