            "title": "Awqatlar dizimin (menyu) dúziw boyınsha usınıslar",
            "created_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2025-08-06T14:04:03+02:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003EWed, 08/06/2025 - 14:04\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "updated_at": "\u003Ctime datetime=\"2026-05-19T04:20:43+02:00\" class=\"datetime\"\u003ETue, 05/19/2026 - 04:20\u003C/time\u003E\n",
            "summary": "Hár bir shańaraqta onıń dástúrleri, etnikalıq hám diniy kelip shıǵıwına sáykes túrde ózine tán awqatlanıw ádetleri bar. Joqarıda perzentlerińiz hám basqa shańaraq aǵzalarıńız ushın paydalı hám arzan bolǵan azıq-awqatlar usınıs etildi; olar shańaraqlıq menyuińizdi bayıtıwǵa hám shańaraqtıń ekonomikalıq jaǵdayın esapqa alǵan halda ayırım jańa ónimlerden paydalanıwǵa járdem beredi.",
            "body": "\u003Cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EAzanǵı awqat ushın usınıs etiletuǵın ónimler:\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003ESır, máyek, sút qosılǵan quwırılǵan nan\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003ESútte pisirilgen maydalanǵan mákke kashası\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003EMalina, júzim qosılıp pisirilgen sulı kashası\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003EMákke nanı\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003EMákke badıraǵı/sútli myusli\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003EQaynatılǵan máyek yamasa quymaq\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Meals-in-minutes-1-porridge.jpg\" alt=\"Bolalar uchun tez sog'lom ovqatlanish: rasmlarda\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003ETúslik ushın usınıs etiletuǵın ónimler:\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003EPalızlar, kók shóp qosılǵan gúrishli sorpa (mastava)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003ESobıqlı (noqat, lobiya) sorpa, nan hám jańa tayarlanǵan palızlı salat\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003EKapusta / bolgar burıshına grechka yamasa gúrish salıp pisirilgen dolma\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003EJańa tayarlanǵan palızlı salat (geshir, petrushka, láblebi, túrpi, kapusta)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003EPalızlar menen demlengen gósh\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003EPalızlı balıq sorpası\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Meals-in-minutes-7-chicken.jpg\" alt=\"Bolalar uchun tez sog'lom ovqatlanish: rasmlarda\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EKeshki awqat ushın usınıs etiletuǵın ónimler:\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003EKartoshkalı pirojkiler (kapusta yamasa shpinat qosılǵan)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003EGúrish hám asqabaqtan tayarlanǵan sútli kasha (shireli qabaq)\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003EMáwsimlik palızli salat penen demlengen yamasa qaynatılǵan kartoshka\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003EBir kese sút yamasa qatıq\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Meals-in-minutes-5-wraps.jpg\" alt=\"Bolalar uchun tez sog'lom ovqatlanish: rasmlarda\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EJeńil awqat ushın usınıs etiletuǵın ónimler:\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003EJańa miywe yamasa miyweli salat\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003EÚyde kakao, varenye hám miyweler qosıp tayarlanǵan (máyek qosılmaǵan) konditer ónimi\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003EÚyde islengen varenye / qoyıw qárelı povidlosı jaǵılǵan nan\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003EGúrish, máyek yamasa azıraq muǵdardaǵı jańa miywelerden tayarlanǵan konditer ónimleri\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003ESherbet\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli dir=\"ltr\"\u003EMiyweler salınǵan qatıq\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cimg src=\"https://bebbo.app/sites/default/files/2020-06/Meals-in-minutes-3-smoothie.jpg\" alt=\"Bolalar uchun tez sog'lom ovqatlanish: rasmlarda\"\u003E\u003C/p\u003E",
